{"seq":4,"slug":"efficient-networks","title":"高效网络设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/deep-learning/architectures-and-trends/efficient-networks","wordCount":1117,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"高效网络设计\">高效网络设计</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高效网络设计聚焦于在有限的计算资源和部署约束下实现最优的性能。随着深度学习从云端走向边缘设备（手机、IoT、嵌入式系统），模型的推理延迟、内存占用和能耗成为与精度同等重要的指标。高效网络设计包含两个互补的方向：轻量级架构设计（从头设计小模型）和模型压缩（将大模型压缩为小模型）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;高效网络&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;轻量级架构&lt;br/&gt;MobileNet, ShuffleNet&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;模型压缩&lt;br/&gt;从大到小&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;知识蒸馏&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; E[&quot;网络剪枝&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; F[&quot;量化&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; G[&quot;低秩分解&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; H[&quot;部署到&lt;br/&gt;边缘设备&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; H\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"高效网络\"] --&gt; B[\"轻量级架构&lt;br/&gt;MobileNet, ShuffleNet\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"模型压缩&lt;br/&gt;从大到小\"]\n    C --&gt; D[\"知识蒸馏\"]\n    C --&gt; E[\"网络剪枝\"]\n    C --&gt; F[\"量化\"]\n    C --&gt; G[\"低秩分解\"]\n    B --&gt; H[\"部署到&lt;br/&gt;边缘设备\"]\n    C --&gt; H</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>压缩比</th>\n<th>精度损失</th>\n<th>实现难度</th>\n<th>适用阶段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>知识蒸馏</td>\n<td>教师→学生</td>\n<td>2-10x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>训练</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构化剪枝</td>\n<td>移除通道/层</td>\n<td>2-5x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>训练后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>非结构化剪枝</td>\n<td>移除单个权重</td>\n<td>5-20x</td>\n<td>小</td>\n<td>高（需硬件）</td>\n<td>训练后</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>INT8 量化</td>\n<td>降低精度</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>极小</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>推理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>低秩分解</td>\n<td>矩阵近似</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>训练后</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"mobilenet-与轻量级架构\">MobileNet 与轻量级架构</h2><p>MobileNet 系列是轻量级 CNN 设计的典范。MobileNetV1 的核心创新是深度可分离卷积（Depthwise Separable Convolution），将标准卷积分解为逐通道卷积和 1×1 逐点卷积，参数量和计算量减少约 8-9 倍。</p>\n<p>MobileNetV2 引入了倒残差块（Inverted Residual Block）：先用 1×1 卷积扩展通道（扩展因子 6），再做深度卷积，最后用 1×1 卷积压缩回去。线性瓶颈（最后不使用激活函数）保留了低维特征的信息。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch.nn as nn&#10;&#10;class InvertedResidual(nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride, expand_ratio):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        mid_ch = in_ch * expand_ratio&#10;        self.use_residual = stride == 1 and in_ch == out_ch&#10;        layers = []&#10;        if expand_ratio != 1:&#10;            layers.extend([&#10;                nn.Conv2d(in_ch, mid_ch, 1, bias=False),&#10;                nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),&#10;                nn.ReLU6(inplace=True),&#10;            ])&#10;        layers.extend([&#10;            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, mid_ch, 3, stride=stride, padding=1, groups=mid_ch, bias=False),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),&#10;            nn.ReLU6(inplace=True),&#10;            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, out_ch, 1, bias=False),&#10;            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),&#10;        ])&#10;        self.conv = nn.Sequential(*layers)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x):&#10;        if self.use_residual:&#10;            return x + self.conv(x)&#10;        return self.conv(x)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> InvertedResidual</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_ch, out_ch, stride, expand_ratio):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        mid_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expand_ratio</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.use_residual </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> stride </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> and</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> in_ch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out_ch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> []</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expand_ratio </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            layers.extend([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                nn.Conv2d(in_ch, mid_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">                nn.ReLU6(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inplace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        layers.extend([</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, mid_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">stride</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">stride, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">padding</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">groups</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">mid_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(mid_ch),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.ReLU6(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">inplace</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.Conv2d(mid_ch, out_ch, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            nn.BatchNorm2d(out_ch),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        ])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nn.Sequential(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">layers)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.use_residual:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">            return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv(x)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ShuffleNet 通过通道混洗（Channel Shuffle）解决分组卷积中通道间信息不流通的问题。ShuffleNetV2 进一步提出了四条高效网络设计准则：等通道宽度最小化内存访问成本、避免过多的分组卷积、减少网络碎片化、减少逐元素操作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 倒残差块&#10;        A[&quot;输入&lt;br/&gt;低维&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;1×1 扩展&lt;br/&gt;高维&quot;]&#10;        B --&gt; C[&quot;3×3 深度卷积&lt;br/&gt;高维&quot;]&#10;        C --&gt; D[&quot;1×1 压缩&lt;br/&gt;低维&quot;]&#10;        A --&gt; ADD((&quot;+&quot;))&#10;        D --&gt; ADD&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 倒残差块\n        A[\"输入&lt;br/&gt;低维\"] --&gt; B[\"1×1 扩展&lt;br/&gt;高维\"]\n        B --&gt; C[\"3×3 深度卷积&lt;br/&gt;高维\"]\n        C --&gt; D[\"1×1 压缩&lt;br/&gt;低维\"]\n        A --&gt; ADD((\"+\"))\n        D --&gt; ADD\n    end</pre><h2 id=\"知识蒸馏\">知识蒸馏</h2><p>知识蒸馏（Knowledge Distillation）通过让小型学生模型学习大型教师模型的&quot;暗知识&quot;（soft predictions）来提升学生的性能。教师的 softmax 输出包含了类别之间的相似度信息（如数字 3 与 8 更相似），这些信息对学生的学习非常有价值。</p>\n<p>蒸馏损失由硬标签损失和软标签损失加权组合：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>α</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>C</mi><mi>E</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>α</mi><msup><mi>T</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msub><mi mathvariant=\"script\">L</mi><mrow><mi>K</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msubsup><mi>p</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{L} = (1-\\alpha)\\mathcal{L}_{CE}(y, p_s) + \\alpha T^2 \\mathcal{L}_{KL}(p_t^T, p_s^T)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"m